Viktor 10.10.2026: «Жги переводы дальше, бро, и доводи всё до всех запланированных языков».

The room's texts are whole sentences now, so each language says them in its own order and forms: the cost, the sampling line, a picture's caption, a run's state, the progress, the toasts and dialogs are one tr() each, and a count is «1 picture» or «N pictures» (countOf), which the catalogs give in their plural forms (1 картинка, 2 картинки, 5 картинок). Names and machine words keep as written: the log, the sampler and schedule names, a reference's file name, a failed run's error.

1339b: the room's head names both painters (Krea 2 Muse or Qwen-Image); the stage's Upscale tip says 2K or 4K by the long side; a painter's option says «from N GB» as one text (the bare «from» read «из»); the log counts a run's pictures in the language's forms and writes a waiting run's reason in the page's language.

The catalogs: three blocks for the room (300 keys a language), built by heresy/MISC/claude-i18n/1339/build_1339.py from batches checked for placeholders, numbers, the Latin names and no «раб» in Russian. The kitchen suite 622/0.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
